title: Add AutoXcmWeight and weight-info provider macros to pallet-xcm-benchmarks
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds the `xcm_weights` module to `pallet-xcm-benchmarks` (`AutoXcmWeight`, `AutoXcmWeightConfig`, and
      relay-style and count-based asset weighers) together with the
      `impl_xcm_generic_weight_info_provider!` and `impl_xcm_fungible_weight_info_provider!` macros.
      Runtimes can use them to derive their `XcmWeightInfo` from the generated `pallet_xcm_benchmarks`
      weights instead of maintaining hand-written implementations, overriding only the instructions that
      differ from the defaults. No runtime is migrated by this change.

crates:
  - name: xcm-procedural
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-xcm-benchmarks
    bump: minor
